(b)(2)(i) (2)(i) Except as otherwise provided in paragraph (a)(2)(ii) of this section and in § 1140.16(c)(2)(i), each retailer must verify by means of photographic identification containing the bearer's date of birth that no person purchasing the product is younger than 21 years of age;
(b)(2)(ii) (ii) No such verification is required for any person over the age of 29; and
